yle=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Initial Stage BRV Boost\"><img alt=\"Initial Stage BRV Boost\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Capricious Thief\"><img alt=\"Capricious Thief\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imaginary Soldier\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Soldier\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Capricious Reaper\"><img alt=\"Capricious Reaper\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>There's no way to get all of them but lots of ways to get four. I used a Multichain at B3 for that, getting the purple emblem to boost initial Bravery. I also used a KP Gambler, of course, why not? The KP Chance is a 30 second win, and the bonus line is, you guess it, 50. If you don't think you can do it, there's no shame in buying a KP Switch as well.\n</p><p>First, a Level 43 Capricious Thief. Second, a Level 51 Phantasmal Harlequin with Ultros. Then comes a Level 51 Imaginary Champion with the auto version of Bahamut. Last is a Level 52 Capricious Reaper, not sure what summon he has. The two enemies left are a Level 52 Ephemeral Phantom with Chocobo, and an Imaginary Soldier with no summon.\n</p><p>The chest has a Pink Tail.\n</p><p>On the world map with this gateway unsealed, head forward to the rock and grind to the island to find a Crystal. You probably have enough to trade for more Crystal equipment so I'll cover over that. Like the Gold and Mythril stuff, wearing three pieces of Crystal equipment activates the Blessed Crystal combination, giving you +20% from EX Force and EX Cores. Pretty helpful and the Crystal stuff has better stats than the Gold stuff, it's up to you. I'm sticking with the Gold stuff just for extra cash, but if you're someone hwo likes abusing EX Mode, go ahead with the Crystal stuff, and throw in two Cyan Drops too.\n</p><p>Beyond that Crystal though, this area has little. There's a teleport stone here, but the one path is barred by a closed gateway. Head through the open path to a new region.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gulg_Volcano_Ring\">Gulg Volcano Ring</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Gulg Volcano Ring\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_22?action=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Gulg Volcano Ring\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/17/World_B_Volcano_Ring_Gulg.png/revision/latest?cb=20110505201750\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ancient Volcano Ring - Gulg\"><img alt=\"Ancient Volcano Ring - Gulg\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"216\" height=\"181\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"World B Volcano Ring Gulg.png\" data-image-key=\"World_B_Volcano_Ring_Gulg.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/17/World_B_Volcano_Ring_Gulg.png/revision/latest?cb=20110505201750\" /></a><figcaption>Ancient Volcano Ring - Gulg</figcaption></figure>\n<p>This region also covers the Crescent Lake area down to that island where the teleport stone was in the 013 story. There's only one gateway in this region, but lots of treasures and our first map enemies, as you can see from the map. Follow the path to the waterfront, the gateway to the left is sealed so smash the rock and grind over. The chest has a Diamond, which naturally trades for Diamond equipment, but it's Level 60 gear and a few levels out of our range now. Go along the path to a split, you can go up into the volcano, or to a gateway.\n</p><p>Up in the volcano is a chest with a KP Bonus, and our first map enemy, a Delusory Warlock Level 88, ouch. He has Demon Wall, a Delusory Knight Assist, Level 60 equipment with Level 100 Armor, and a Hyper Ring with 9 Near Loss bostters. He is easily the most challenging opponent in the game so far, have fun. Remember and feel free to use the entire party to fight him, fortunately when fighting on the overworld, party members are automatically healed after a fight, so it's five-on-one with no penalties.\n</p><p>Now just head into the gateway you passed, Encounters and Treason.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20121006224522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Party Battle\"><img alt=\"Party Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Party Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20121006224522\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><b>AC</b>\n</th>\n