<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20121006224522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Party Battle\"><img alt=\"Party Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Party Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20121006224522\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Booster Accessory x5\"><img alt=\"Booster Accessory x5\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Blue.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Blue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/8/8f/D012_Emblem_Blue.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209004544\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20121006224522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Party Battle\"><img alt=\"Party Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Party Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20121006224522\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Tome of...\"><img alt=\"Tome of...\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><b>AC</b>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20121006224522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Party Battle\"><img alt=\"Party Battle\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Party Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/5f/D012_Party_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20121006224522\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This is the best place in the game at the moment to grind for KP. Multichain at A3 with a KP Gambler to chain all three enemies and get 243 KP. Add in a KP Bonus or two to spice it up even more. The bonus line is 60, and the KP Chance is a 30 second Break.\n</p><p>First up are a Level 60 Imaginary Brawler and Level 60 Transient Gunner. Then comes a Level 51 Phantasmal Harlequin with Ultros and Level 51 Imaginary Champion with auto Bahamut. Then comes a Level 50 Imitation Despot with an unknown summon, probably Brynhildr since the last Despot had that, and Level 50 Counterfeit Wraith with Hecatoncheir. The last party is a Level 60 Ephemeral Summoner, Level 61 False Hero, and Level 61 Imitation Liegeman.\n</p><p>The two chests have a random Tome (I think) and a Pink Tail. The Tome I got was a Tome of Lies. This gave me to the two I needed for a Beckoning Cat, but I was also short a Lucky Charm. Getting more requires Wanderer's Desire and Despot's Desire, which we have plenty of, and Ghost, Battlegen'd from the Phantom Train. Go Battlegen some now, I did. The Lucky Charm and the Rabbit's Foot it trades for trade for Hero's Essense and Hero's Spirit, which give us more CP so we can equip more abilities at a time and master them faster.\n</p><p>Also note at this point I gave leadership to Prishe to level her up faster, she was level 33 by this point so she could take the enemies on with a bit of help from the right summons like Bahamut, Kraken, Behemoth, etc. I bought her an Iron Fan for a weapon which begins the fight with a 20% Assist charge, helpful since as I said above she needs Assists to land her slow HP attacks.\n</p><p>Beyond the gateway is a moogle, this is the second awesome thing, that gateway not only has 9 enemies to chain, but it's about two feet from a moogle who sells Multichains and KP Gamblers, so KP grinding is quick and easy! Sure you get a penalty if you're over level 60, but if you do the math, you're getting 240 KP a run, so even at level 100 you're just losing 40 KP, but the level advantage makes the fights go much quicker, so it evens out. The moogle sells the Warlord and Heike equipment, the Warlord stuff is level 30 armor with a Combiation, but unlike the Mythril and Gold stuff you need all four pieces to activate it, lamely the effect is just faster Bravery recovery. The Heike equipment is level 60 and gives you a full EX Gauge at the start of each fight, but in return your EX Mode only lasts half as long. Quite useful I imagine for someone like Cloud or Terra, with EX Mode damage buffs so awesome they don't <i>need</i> a lot of time in EX Mode to batter the opponent and end the fight.\n</p><p>Near the moogle is a Level 88 Imaginary Champion to play with, he has the normal Bahamut. Beyond it is a chest with a <b>KP Bonus</b>. I bolded that because if you don't need KP Bonuses, or have no room for them in the skill list, leave the chests with them alone. The only way to get more aside from the chests is the Cornelia moogle, which only sells one a day on a specific two days or so, so leave the chests be and come back for them later when you need them, just scroll up and down the page looking for the bolded KP Bonus word to find them when you need them. Further down the main path is a Diamond, and further down is the Gateway of Melting Sorrows.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/DFF_Rare_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235927\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Pink Tail\"><img alt=\"Pink Tail\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Rare Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Rare_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/DFF_Rare_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203235927\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"ht