t=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Initial BRV 0 for both\"><img alt=\"Initial BRV 0 for both\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><b>AC</b>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Initial BRV Boost for both\"><img alt=\"Initial BRV Boost for both\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imaginary Soldier\"><img alt=\"Imaginary Soldier\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Transient Lion\"><img alt=\"Transient Lion\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Tome of Memories\"><img alt=\"Tome of Memories\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/e/ef/D012_Locked_Area.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209051329\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Complete &quot;Chasm in the Rotting Land&quot;\"><img alt=\"Complete &quot;Chasm in the Rotting Land&quot;\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Locked Area.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Locked_Area.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/e/ef/D012_Locked_Area.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209051329\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/DFF_Rare_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235927\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Pink Tail\"><img alt=\"Pink Tail\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Rare Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Rare_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/6/6b/DFF_Rare_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203235927\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Multichain where you come in at A5 to get them all, or Jump Chain at C4 to get them all with the Initial BRV 0 purple emblem. Strictly speaking you can just get to the exit and unseal the gateway just by fighting your Assist. They'll come in at level 100 with full equipment and accessories and an Assist of their own, while you have none. You don't actually have to beat your Assist though, just challenge it and then flee and it will vanish and leave the way open. But you can try to beat it if you want a challenge. You might as well just do this to unseal the gateway, with only five enemies there's no point chaining them. The KP Chance is a 30 second win and the bonus line is 60.\n</p><p>The enemies are a Level 63 Capricious Thief, a Level 59 Fleeting Flash, a Level 63 Imaginary Soldier, Level 59 Idle Sky Pirate, and Level 63 Transient Lion. None of them have summons or Assists, fortunately. The Assist I faced here was fought in Order's Sanctuary Ω, which surprisingly to me I hadn't fought in before, and I believe all your Assist matches in 000 are fought here. Order's Sanctuary, the Bravery pool is permanently set at 0, because inflicting Break grant no stage bonus, instead it instantly doubles your Bravery. Sometimes awesome, more often then not very annoying.\n</p><p>I got a Tome of the Farplane from the chest, but again I think it's random.\n</p><p>Beyond this gateway, there's no teleport stone, but there is a moogle! He sells many, though not all, of the trade components in the game, including Mythril, Gold, Crystal, and Diamond. I bought four Diamonds so I could use the Diamond gear and begin AP grinding. Be warned though, unlike the Gold and Mythril sets, there is no Diamond Staff, and with only Armor and Vest for body armor, mages won't be able to use the set. Well, there <i>is</i> a way, but it costs 500,000 gil, quite a bit out of our price range at the moment. The moogle also sells attack skills, like EX, BRV and Assist Charge, Soundwave, Maser Eye, etc. I also traded in my two Hi-Elixirs from the Cornelia moogle to get a Darksteel Ingot, allowing me to get the powerful Save the Queen sword. The equivalent Rod, sadly, needed a Moore Log which also needed two Hi-Elixirs, but I bought a Macalania Timber from the Moogle to trade up to the almost as good Staff of the Magi, giving Terra a Level 60 weapon. I also bought from him a Chimera Hide to get Prishe the Burning Fist, since the Cat Claws too, needed two Hi-Elixirs to get a Behemoth Leather for trade.\n</p><p>Return to the Frozen Continent gateway and head out into the larger snowfield area now. Make a right as you walk out to find another Imaginary Champion to fight. The chest behind it has a Gold Angel. Opposite the castle shatter the rock and cross over to grab a Crystal. Now head far to the left to the Melmond Fens - from here you can see a gateway, we'll get to it shortly.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Melmond_Fens\">Melmond Fens</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Melmond Fens\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_22?action=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Melmond Fens\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b6/World_B_Melmond_Fens.png/revision/latest?cb=20110505202647\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Melmond Fens\"><img alt=\"Melmond Fens\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"338\" height=\"262\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"World B Melmond Fens.png\" data-image-key=\"World_B_Melmond_Fens.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b6/World_B_Melmond_Fens.png/revision/latest?cb=20110505202647\" /></a><figcaption>Melmond Fens</figcaption></figure>\n<p>There's actually very little to do here, no gateways to unlock as you can see save for two, and they're special ones. Go out and to the right to find a Level 89 Transient Witch with Kraken to fight, and she's got an Iifa Dew, yay. The island has a Diamond on it. On the other path you can see two distant gateways over the see, the moogle says that one of them is the Chasm in the Rotting Land, where the mured moogle is sealed, but the only way there is by teleport stone. Head further into the region and grind over to an island with a Crystal. \n</p><p>After heading through an empty gateway in the mountains, turn left, it will begin to rain here. Soon you're come to a teleport stone in a ruined town, smash the rock and grind over to a chest with a Diamond. Cross the swamplands and you'll find another Transient Witch to make friends with. On the beach behind it is a <b>KP Bonus</b>. Return to the previously mentioned gateway and go right this time. Go to the right this time and smash the rock, the island has yet another Crystal. The gateway here leads back to the Cornelia region.\n</p><p>Well, we've explore the entire world now. Go visit the various moogles and buy whatever needed, grab some of the listed KP Bonuses and grind for KP as I told you if you're poor. We can head to the mured moogle's resting place, but first, there's two optional gateways to explore. Grab a couple Multichains any maybe a KP Gambler, then head to a teleport stone.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"toccolours\" width=\"85%\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; margin:0 auto; text-align: center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align: center; border:solid 1px\"><b><a href=\"/story/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake\">Drake Clawfang's Dissidia 012 Walkthrough</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"10%\" style=\"border:solid 1px\" rowspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/story/013-light/epilogue-part-2/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 21\">Previous page</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table width=\"100%\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Treachery_of_the_Gods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Treachery of the Gods\">Treachery of the Gods</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/story/012-treachery/prologue-chapter-1/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 1\">Prologue / Chapter 1</a> - <a href=\"/story/012-treachery/chapter-2/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 2\">2</a> - <a href=\"/story/012-treachery/chapter-3/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 3\">3</a> - <a href=\"/story/012-treachery/chapter-4/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 4\">4</a> - <a href=\"/story/012-treachery/chapter-5/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 5\">5</a> - <a href=\"/story/012-treachery/chapter-6/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 6\">6</a> - <a href=\"/story/012-treachery/chapter-7/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 7\">7</a> - <a href=\"/story/012-treachery/epilogue/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 8\">Epilogue</a><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Light_to_All\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Light to All\">Light to All</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/story/013-light/prologue/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 9\">Prologue</a> - <a href=\"/story/013-light/chapter-1/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 10\">Chapter 1</a> - <a hr